 "about": "Registration plan for the ricercar skeleton (design/final-lab/SK_final.ly, 66 bars) on the Norrfjärden organ: terraced registration at the plan's joins instead of hairpins. Quiet 8' exposition, principals building through the stretto, plenum with pedal reeds for Climax I; the arioso as a Sesquialtera solo on the Rückpositief over the Oberwerck's Quintadena; the inverted fugue building again from 8' flutes; plenum and pedal reeds for Climax II and the apotheosis; a quiet principal coda (pp in the plan).",
